BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:DCN Warsaw 2026
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261007
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261008
DTSTAMP:20260810T100034Z
UID:e9600c0525fc0314@waw-calendars
CATEGORIES:targi
DESCRIPTION:The Warsaw data center market is a dynamic and rapidly expandi
 ng hub for digital infrastructure in Central and Eastern Europe. With sign
 ificant growth projected\, the Polish data center market is on track to re
 ach USD 3.78 billion by 2030\, representing a CAGR of over 15.7%. This exp
 losive growth is driven by hyperscale investment\, the rise of AI and high
 -performance computing\, and Warsaw’s strategic geographic location coup
 led with a strong focus on sustainability through the increasing use of re
